    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:5a4836cca1208c95",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "e154951ed8bd84b3eb27d15783ef1117382e4bd59463ed1dd04d4ecf6c6910df",
      "text": "Take in the breathtaking view as your plane descends upon Rio de Janeiro, the “Marvellous City”, where green hills, turquoise ocean, sandy beaches and high-rise neighbourhoods come together in a unique blend of life. Your driver takes you from the airport to the hotel, past colonial-style buildings and along the world-famous beachfront.\n\nThe natural beauty of Rio, framed by the Atlantic rainforest, sits alongside everything that makes a great Latin American city. A walk along the mosaic promenade of Copacabana reveals much about the life of the cariocas, as Rio’s locals are known: a refreshing caipirinha as the waves lap the shore, a fiercely competitive game of foot-volley and crowds enjoying the sun on the golden sand.",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "word_exact",
        "fileId": "1aCfUof3lkdtQfBCwO9Ba-h50KrdB7lwo",
        "documentSha256": "01f91d9a62e5de0bcd5f5a154fdb15b5d496d64f5365cc0c63d02c707a5b7767",
